flowchart TB
accTitle: Transcoding creates the package that the CDN serves
accDescr: MediaConvert turns a master video into an HLS manifest and multiple renditions, while only the original master follows the archival lifecycle.
MASTER[S3 MP4 master]:::inputData --> MC[MediaConvert HLS job]
MC --> MAN[HLS manifest]:::storage
MC --> LOW[Low bitrate segments]:::storage
MC --> HIGH[High bitrate segments]:::storage
MAN --> CF[CloudFront]
LOW --> CF
HIGH --> CF
CF --> PLAYER[Player selects a supported rendition]:::output
MC -. after processing, master-only lifecycle .-> ARCHIVE[Original master<br/>Glacier Instant Retrieval]:::storage
